I go to the window.
The window is large and tall.
I press my hand against the glass.
The glass is very cold.
I look at the city.
The city is still unfamiliar.
It is January.
Outside it is icy and dark.
Where am I?
I am in Germany.
But I come from Mexico.
Mexico is so far away.
It is warm there.
Here there is only winter.
I am suddenly homesick.
I miss the warmth.
I miss my family.
What do I do now?
I close my eyes.
But my new life begins here now.
